## Raspberry Pi static demo

Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W uses 16 bit color, so I made a simple static shader.

@scaleDiv(66){
    ![Raspberry Pi demo](/posts/LinuxFrameBuffer/raspberry_demo.jpeg)
}

Looking closely, you can see the color discontinuity in the image, which is a consequence of the limited color resolution.


